<title>JAPAN: Zett - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Zett - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 25.24		vs	   26.19</p>
<p> Operating	   49 million	 vs	  281 million</p>
<p> Current	 loss 5 million	 vs	prft 307 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 67 million	 vs	prft 100 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.35 yen	  vs     prft 5.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Zett Corp is the largest wholesaler of sporting goods.</p>
